LLMs have introduced a paradigm shift, enabling zero-shot repair capabilities from natural language or
code context (Xia and Zhang, 2022; Xia et al., 2023). This has inspired LLM-based agent frameworks
for APR that simulate human workflows with structured tool usage and reasoning (Antoniades et al.,
2025; Nguyen et al., 2024a; Phan et al., 2024; Wang et al., 2024a; Xia et al., 2024b; Yang et al., 2024b;
